   165	
   166	Neither report isolates this, and it answers "does the pin survive off NU-TWO?".
   167	With `c := n - M_s - 1` (RADIUS-ORDER in general form, `box/moh_skeleton_N.py:189-193`):
   168	
   169	```text
   170	   lambda_g(delta_r) = -n(1-delta_r)c/(n-M_r),
   171	   floor(r) - ceiling(r) = (1-delta_r)[1 - (n+m)c/(n-M_r)],
   172	   at r = 1  (n - M_1 = n + m):   floor(1) - ceiling(1) = (1-delta_1)(1-c).
   173	```
   174	
   175	The coincidence holds **iff `c = 1`, i.e. `M_s = n-2`** (`delta_1 = 1` is excluded: it
   176	gives `lambda_g(delta_1) = 0`, hence `N = 0`, against `N >= 2`). Perturbation check on
   177	census-legal skeletons with `M_s` lowered, exact `Fraction`s:
