   212	entire reducible/irreducible distinction is a statement about the zero-contributing
   213	block.** `N = Σ_B V₂(B) q(B)` is unchanged when `A_F` is reducible — not because the
   214	derivation was careless about `A_F`, but because it is orthogonal to it.
