+# Ideation round 20260903T1015Z -- GPT-5.5 blind submission
+
+## 0. Custody, Scope, And Direct Stance
+
+Packet hash checked first:
+
+```text
+99c940d1167acfc7796436457a1d87bdd0a1a1a4c673c7bb2e0d3436e3d086b7  /tmp/jc2-lane.w5T3r6/inputs/ideation-20260903T1015Z-packet.md
