+* Rank drops only mod `p`: harvest as a possible p-curvature/Cartier signal but
+  do not promote a characteristic-zero pass.
+* NO-RESIDUE failing mod `p` kills the branch over `Q`.
+
+Stop condition: two prime disagreements without a rational explanation.
+Expected information gain: medium-high as acceleration; low as a standalone
+proof.
